    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence2-182",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "時孝儀置酒，粲怒，以杯抵地曰：「賊已渡江，便逼宮闕，水陸俱斷，何暇有報；假令無敕，豈得自安？",
      "reading": "粲斥既渡江，水陸既斷，不能坐待敕報。",
      "note": "粲斥既渡江，水陸既斷，不能坐待敕報。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 182,
      "end_codepoint": 228,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence2-228",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "韋粲今日何情飲酒！」",
      "reading": "粲以本名自稱。",
      "note": "粲以本名自稱。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 228,
      "end_codepoint": 238,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence2-238",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "卽馳馬出，部分將發，會江州刺史當陽公大心遣使要粲，粲乃馳往見大心曰：「上游蕃鎮，江州去京最近，殿下情計，實宜在前；但中流任重，當須應接，不可闕鎮。",
      "reading": "當陽公大心遣使，粲陳江州守鎮之責。",
      "note": "當陽公大心遣使，粲陳江州守鎮之責。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 238,
      "end_codepoint": 311,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence2-311",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "今直且張聲勢，移鎮湓城，遣偏將賜隨，於事便足。」",
      "reading": "勸移鎮湓城而遣偏將。",
      "note": "勸移鎮湓城而遣偏將。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 311,
      "end_codepoint": 335,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence2-335",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "大心然之，遣中兵柳昕帥兵二千人隨粲。",
      "reading": "大心派柳昕，兵二千。",
      "note": "大心派柳昕，兵二千。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 335,
      "end_codepoint": 353,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence2-353",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "粲悉留家累於江州，以輕舸就路。",
      "reading": "粲留家累江州，輕舸行。",
      "note": "粲留家累江州，輕舸行。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 353,
      "end_codepoint": 368,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence2-368",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "至南州，粲外弟司州刺史柳仲禮亦帥步騎萬餘人至橫江，粲卽送糧仗贍給之，並散私金帛以賞其戰士。",
      "reading": "外弟柳仲禮領萬餘人到橫江，粲以糧仗金帛援之。",
      "note": "外弟柳仲禮領萬餘人到橫江，粲以糧仗金帛援之。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 368,
      "end_codepoint": 413,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "先是，安北將軍鄱陽王範亦自合肥遣西豫州刺史裴之高與其長子嗣，帥江西之衆赴京師，屯於張公洲，待上流諸軍至。",
      "reading": "安北鄱陽王蕭範派裴之高與自己長子嗣赴援。",
      "note": "安北鄱陽王蕭範派裴之高與自己長子嗣赴援。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 52,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-52",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "是時，之高遣船渡仲禮，與合軍進屯王游苑。",
      "reading": "裴之高遣船接柳仲禮。",
      "note": "裴之高遣船接柳仲禮。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 52,
      "end_codepoint": 72,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-72",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "粲建議推仲禮爲大都督，報下流衆軍。",
      "reading": "粲推柳為大都督。",
      "note": "粲推柳為大都督。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 72,
      "end_codepoint": 89,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-89",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "裴之高自以年位恥居其下，乃云：「柳節下是州將，何須我復鞭板？」",
      "reading": "裴自負資格，以柳節下稱仲禮，辭居其下。",
      "note": "裴自負資格，以柳節下稱仲禮，辭居其下。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 89,
      "end_codepoint": 120,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-120",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "累日不決。",
      "reading": "累日未定。",
      "note": "累日未定。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 120,
      "end_codepoint": 125,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-125",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "粲乃抗言於衆曰：「今者同赴國難，義在除賊，所以推柳司州者，政以久捍邊疆，先爲侯景所憚；且士馬精銳，無出其前。",
      "reading": "粲言推柳因守邊已久、為景所憚。",
      "note": "粲言推柳因守邊已久、為景所憚。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 125,
      "end_codepoint": 179,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-179",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "若論位次，柳在粲下；語其年齒，亦少於粲，直以社稷之計，不得復論。",
      "reading": "柳位與年俱在粲下，粲請以國事為重。",
      "note": "柳位與年俱在粲下，粲請以國事為重。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 179,
      "end_codepoint": 211,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-211",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "今日形勢，貴在將和；若人心不同，大事去矣。",
      "reading": "粲勸諸將和同。",
      "note": "粲勸諸將和同。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 211,
      "end_codepoint": 232,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-232",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "裴公朝之舊齒，年德已隆，豈應復挾私情，以沮大計。",
      "reading": "稱前輩裴公年德俱高。",
      "note": "稱前輩裴公年德俱高。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 232,
      "end_codepoint": 256,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-256",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "粲請爲諸君解釋之。」",
      "reading": "粲請親向裴解釋。",
      "note": "粲請親向裴解釋。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 256,
      "end_codepoint": 266,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-266",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "乃單舸至之高營，切讓之曰：「前諸將之議，豫州意所未同，卽二宮危逼，猾寇滔天，臣子當戮力同心，豈可自相矛盾！",
      "reading": "粲至裴營，以豫州面稱裴，二宮危急勸同心。",
      "note": "粲至裴營，以豫州面稱裴，二宮危急勸同心。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 266,
      "end_codepoint": 319,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-319",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "豫州必欲立異，鋒鏑便有所歸。」",
      "reading": "粲向裴申言不宜異議。",
      "note": "粲向裴申言不宜異議。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 319,
      "end_codepoint": 334,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-334",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "之高垂泣曰：「吾荷國恩榮，自應帥先士卒，顧恨衰老，不能效命，企望柳使君共平凶逆，謂衆議已從，無俟老夫耳。",
      "reading": "裴以吾、老夫自稱，說明並願柳使君平亂。",
      "note": "裴以吾、老夫自稱，說明並願柳使君平亂。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 334,
      "end_codepoint": 386,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-386",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "若必有疑，當剖心相示。」",
      "reading": "裴表示可以示誠。",
      "note": "裴表示可以示誠。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 386,
      "end_codepoint": 398,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence3-398",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "於是諸將定議，仲禮方得進軍。",
      "reading": "諸將定議，柳開始進軍。",
      "note": "諸將定議，柳開始進軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 398,
      "end_codepoint": 412,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "次新亭，賊列陣於中興寺，相持至晚，各解歸。",
      "reading": "新亭兩軍相持至晚。",
      "note": "新亭兩軍相持至晚。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 21,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence4-21",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "是夜，仲禮入粲營，部分衆軍，旦日將戰，諸將各有據守，令粲頓青塘。",
      "reading": "夜中柳仲禮入粲營，分守各處，令粲頓青塘。",
      "note": "夜中柳仲禮入粲營，分守各處，令粲頓青塘。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 21,
      "end_codepoint": 53,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence4-53",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "青塘當石頭中路，粲慮柵壘未立，賊必爭之，頗以爲憚，謂仲禮曰：「下官才非禦侮，直欲以身殉國。",
      "reading": "粲以壘柵未立為憂，自稱下官。",
      "note": "粲以壘柵未立為憂，自稱下官。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 53,
      "end_codepoint": 98,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence4-98",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "節下善量其宜，不可致有虧喪。」",
      "reading": "粲請仲禮審慎。",
      "note": "粲請仲禮審慎。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 98,
      "end_codepoint": 113,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence4-113",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "仲禮曰：「青塘立柵，迫近淮渚，欲以糧儲船乘盡就泊之，此是大事，非兄不可。",
      "reading": "仲禮說青塘重要，稱外兄粲為兄。",
      "note": "仲禮說青塘重要，稱外兄粲為兄。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 113,
      "end_codepoint": 149,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence4-149",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "若疑兵少，當更差軍相助。」",
      "reading": "表示可增兵。",
      "note": "表示可增兵。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 149,
      "end_codepoint": 162,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence4-162",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "乃使直閤將軍劉叔胤師助粲，帥所部水陸俱進。",
      "reading": "派劉叔胤助粲。",
      "note": "派劉叔胤助粲。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 162,
      "end_codepoint": 183,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence4-183",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "時值昏霧，軍人迷失道，比及青塘，夜已過半，壘柵至曉未合。",
      "reading": "夜霧迷道，至曉柵未合。",
      "note": "夜霧迷道，至曉柵未合。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 183,
      "end_codepoint": 211,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence4-211",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "景登禪靈寺門閣，望粲營未立，便率銳卒來攻。",
      "reading": "侯景見營未立，領兵來攻。",
      "note": "侯景見營未立，領兵來攻。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 211,
      "end_codepoint": 232,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence4-232",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "軍副王長茂勸據柵待之，粲不從，令軍主鄭逸逆擊之，命劉叔胤以水軍截其後。",
      "reading": "粲未聽王長茂守柵之議，遣鄭逸、劉叔胤出戰。",
      "note": "粲未聽王長茂守柵之議，遣鄭逸、劉叔胤出戰。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 232,
      "end_codepoint": 267,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence4-267",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "叔胤畏懦不敢進，逸遂敗。",
      "reading": "叔胤不進，逸敗。",
      "note": "叔胤不進，逸敗。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 267,
      "end_codepoint": 279,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence4-279",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "賊乘勝入營，左右牽粲避賊，粲不動，猶叱子弟力戰，兵死略盡，遂見害，時年五十四。",
      "reading": "粲力戰被害，報齡五十四。",
      "note": "粲力戰被害，報齡五十四。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 279,
      "end_codepoint": 318,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-weican:received_sentence4-318",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA",
      "source_quote": "粲子尼及三弟助、警、構、從弟昂皆戰死，親戚死者數百人。",
